<section class="flex flex-col items-center gap-10 bg-recilog-bg px-4 py-12 sm:px-6 md:gap-[60px] md:px-10 md:py-16 lg:px-16 lg:py-[60px] xl:px-24 2xl:px-[240px]">
	<h2 class="text-center font-heading text-3xl font-bold text-recilog-dark md:text-4xl lg:text-[54px]">
		¿Por que <span class="text-recilog-green-light">REC</span><span class="text-recilog-green"
			>ILOG</span
		> ?
	</h2>

	<div class="flex w-full flex-col items-center gap-6 lg:flex-row">
		<div
			class="flex w-full flex-1 flex-col items-center justify-center gap-4 rounded-2xl bg-white p-6 drop-shadow-[0px_0px_10px_rgba(10,31,68,0.1)]"
		>
			<p class="w-full font-heading text-[20px] font-bold text-recilog-green">
				Transporte responsable de residuos no peligrosos
			</p>
			<p class="w-full text-[18px] text-recilog-gray">
				Movemos residuos no peligrosos con un servicio seguro, confiable y eficiente, con
				estándares de calidad y enfoque sustentable.
			</p>
		</div>

		<img
			src="/images/illustrations/reduce-reuse-recycle.png"
			alt="Reduce, Reuse, Recycle"
			class="h-auto w-[240px] shrink-0 md:w-[360px] lg:w-[494px]"
		/>

		<div
			class="flex w-full flex-1 flex-col items-center justify-center gap-4 rounded-2xl bg-white p-6 drop-shadow-[0px_0px_10px_rgba(10,31,68,0.1)]"
		>
			<p class="w-full font-heading text-[20px] font-bold text-recilog-green">Flota especializada</p>
			<p class="w-full text-[18px] text-recilog-gray">
